{"id": "20260715174913341645_5e1d333a", "type": "Claim", "text": "The reassessment of the Ring of Nestor’s authenticity is supported
by recent discoveries of Aegean Late Bronze Age imagery (including wall‑paintings, gold rings, figurines, and ivories) and by 
detailed study of the techniques and craftsmanship of unique signet rings dated to the 16th–15th centuries BC.", "source_ids": 
["20260715174845023769_648c270f"], "citations": [17], "sources": [{"source_id": "20260715174845023769_648c270f", "title": "(2020) A.
