"url": 
"https://www.academia.edu/43416584/_2020_A_G_Vlachopoulos_The_Ring_of_Nestor_and_the_quest_for_authenticity_in_F_Blakolmer_ed_Curren
t_Approaches_and_New_Perspectives_in_Aegean_Iconography_Aegis_18_2020_pp_223_252", "source_type": "paper", "published_at": null}]}, 
{"id": "20260715174913474696_f9546181", "type": "Claim", "text": "The modern scholarly article on the Ring of Nestor explicitly aims
to document the ring’s authenticity and to correct historical misconceptions surrounding it.", "source_ids": 
["20260715174845023769_648c270f"], "citations": [17], "sources": [{"source_id": "20260715174845023769_648c270f", "title": "(2020) A.
G. Vlachopoulos, “The Ring of Nestor and the quest for authenticity”, in F. Blakolmer (ed.) Current Approaches and New Perspectives 
