rent_Approaches_and_New_Perspectives_in_Aegean_Iconography_AEGIS_2020_pp._223-252", "source_type": "paper", "published_at": null}]},
{"id": "20260715174315243772_b3c15fc5", "type": "Evidence", "text": "Key takeaway 5: “This text aims to document the authenticity of
the Ring of Nestor and reassess historical misconceptions.”", "source_ids": ["20260715174314431086_1e91a4c4"], "citations": [15], 
