null}]}, {"id": "20260715175720155919_39e13b6d", "type": "Evidence", "text": "“This well–produced volume is efficiently organised 
around six broad themes: the represented body; material culture and the construction of identities; ritualised practice and the 
performance of identities; embodied knowledge through technology and space; the lived body and identities; interaction with the dead
body.”", "source_ids": ["20260715175719070732_5fed65d8"], "citations": [21], "sources": [{"source_id": 
"20260715175719070732_5fed65d8", "title": "[PDF] A Gold Signet Ring (CMS I 16) of the Aegean Late Bronze Age in it", "url": 
